  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Centre for Trade and Sustainable Development (ICTSD) aims to influence the international trading system so that it promotes the goal of sustainable development. As an independent, non-profit NGO, is looking ICTSD empower marginalized stakeholders in the trade policy arena, through information, networking, dialogue, targeted research and capacity building.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The International Centre for Trade and Sustainable Development (ICTSD) arbetar med att p&#xe5;verka det internationella handelssystemet s&#xe5; att det fr&#xe4;mjar m&#xe5;let om en h&#xe5;llbar utveckling. Som en oberoende, icke-vinstdrivande enskild organisation, s&#xf6;ker ICTSD st&#xe4;rka  marginaliserade intressenter inom den handelspolitiska arenan genom information, n&#xe4;tverkande, dialog, forskning och kapacitetsuppbyggnad.</narrative>
  </description>
